# lib_terminal/hosts, a library of ix's tools (mkfiles/mklib): a Tui
# program in a window, what its hosts share, Cells (what changed between
# two screens, painted on a surface) and Picture (a surface in memory,
# with lib_graphics's font's bits); and draw/'s Window_draw, a window
# of mini-rio's (a program takes of a library the units it names). mini-emacs and turbopascal, in a terminal and on
# mini-9pi, each compiled these units before, and the lib_graphics ones
# they name (plan_simpler_builds.md, step 4). sdl/ is dune's alone.
TOP=../..
<$TOP/mkfiles/mkconfig
LIB=lib_terminal/hosts
DIRS=. draw
NEEDS=lib_terminal lib_graphics
UNITS=Cells Picture Window_draw
<$TOP/mkfiles/mklib
